  lines:
  - speaker: You
    text: I'm back?
  - speaker: You
    text: "No\u2026 I was just at the end of the road."
  - speaker: You
    text: Why am I back here?
  - speaker: Radio Echo
    text: The suspect appeared confused...
  - speaker: Homeless Man Echo
    text: The bottle gives the street a voice...
  - speaker: Little Girl Voice
    text: Again.
